---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /curriculum/
title: 三十日课
---
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="kicker">机器可读的课表在仓库根目录 curriculum.yml</p>
    <h1>三十日课</h1>
    <p class="lede">顺序是基础、配色、风格、场景，然后衣橱和细节。不重复题目。现在是十一月，场景先讲秋冬，春夏放在同一逻辑的换季篇里。</p>
  </header>
  <div class="meter" aria-hidden="true">
    <span style="width: {{ (curriculum.published_count / curriculum.total * 100) | round(1) }}%"></span>
  </div>
  <p class="meta">已发布 {{ curriculum.published_count }} / {{ curriculum.total }}。下一篇待写：第 {{ curriculum.computed_next_day }} 天。</p>

  {% if curriculum.computed_next_day %}
    {% set upcoming = curriculum.days | dayByNumber(curriculum.computed_next_day) %}
    <div class="next-box">
      <p class="meta" style="color:#e4d3bc">下一次更新写这一篇</p>
      <p>第 {{ upcoming.day }} 天 · {{ upcoming.section }} · {{ upcoming.title }}</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <ol class="day-list">
    {% for day in curriculum.days %}
    <li>
      <details class="day" {% if day.day == curriculum.computed_next_day %}open{% endif %}>
        <summary class="day-top">
          <h3>第 {{ day.day }} 天 · {{ day.title }}</h3>
          <span class="status {% if day.status == 'published' %}on{% endif %}">{% if day.status == "published" %}已发布{% else %}未发布{% endif %}</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="meta">
          {{ day.section }}
          {% if day.styles and day.styles.length %} · 风格 {{ day.styles | join("、") }}{% endif %}
          {% if day.scenes and day.scenes.length %} · 场景 {{ day.scenes | join("、") }}{% endif %}
          {% if day.seasons and day.seasons.length %} · {{ day.seasons | join("、") }}{% endif %}
          {% if day.published_date %} · {{ day.published_date }}{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="outline">{{ day.outline | trim }}</p>
        {% if day.status == "published" %}
          {% set post = collections.articles | findBySlug(day.id) %}
          {% if post %}<p><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">阅读全文</a></p>{% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      </details>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>
